@host = http://localhost:5080

### Seeded identifiers (see KeyloopScheduler.Infrastructure/Persistence/SeedData.cs)
@dealershipId = a0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@bay1 = b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@bay2 = b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
@bay3 = b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003
@techA = c0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@techB = c0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
@techC = c0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003
@techD = c0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004
@oilService = d0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@brakeService = d0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
@evService = d0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003
@customerA = e0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@customerB = e0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002

### Paste an appointmentId returned by a booking request below before cancelling.
@appointmentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Health probe
GET {{host}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Search availability for Oil & Inspection (30 min) on 2026-09-22
GET {{host}}/api/availability?dealershipId={{dealershipId}}&serviceTypeId={{oilService}}&date=2026-09-22
Accept: application/json

### Search availability for EV Battery Diagnostics (90 min) on 2026-09-22
GET {{host}}/api/availability?dealershipId={{dealershipId}}&serviceTypeId={{evService}}&date=2026-09-22
Accept: application/json

### Book an Oil & Inspection appointment (auto-assign bay + technician closest match)
POST {{host}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dealershipId": "{{dealershipId}}",
  "customerId": "{{customerA}}",
  "serviceTypeId": "{{oilService}}",
  "serviceBayId": null,
  "technicianId": null,
  "vin": "1HGBH41JXMN109186",
  "startTimeUtc": "2026-09-22T09:00:00Z"
}

### Book a Brake Pad Replacement on a specific bay + technician
POST {{host}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dealershipId": "{{dealershipId}}",
  "customerId": "{{customerA}}",
  "serviceTypeId": "{{brakeService}}",
  "serviceBayId": "{{bay2}}",
  "technicianId": "{{techB}}",
  "vin": "2T1BURHE0JC123456",
  "startTimeUtc": "2026-09-22T10:30:00Z"
}

### Conflict demo: same bay + window as the previous request -> expect 409
POST {{host}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dealershipId": "{{dealershipId}}",
  "customerId": "{{customerA}}",
  "serviceTypeId": "{{oilService}}",
  "serviceBayId": "{{bay2}}",
  "technicianId": "{{techA}}",
  "vin": "3VW2K7AJ0EM234567",
  "startTimeUtc": "2026-09-22T10:30:00Z"
}

### Validation demo: non-UTC start -> expect 400
POST {{host}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dealershipId": "{{dealershipId}}",
  "customerId": "{{customerA}}",
  "serviceTypeId": "{{oilService}}",
  "serviceBayId": null,
  "technicianId": null,
  "vin": "1HGBH41JXMN109186",
  "startTimeUtc": "2026-09-22T09:00:00"
}

### Cancel an appointment -> expect 204 No Content (releases bay and technician)
DELETE {{host}}/api/appointments/{{appointmentId}}
Accept: application/json

### Rebook the freed slot -> expect 201 Created (resources are available again)
POST {{host}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dealershipId": "{{dealershipId}}",
  "customerId": "{{customerB}}",
  "serviceTypeId": "{{oilService}}",
  "serviceBayId": "{{bay1}}",
  "technicianId": "{{techA}}",
  "vin": "2T1BURHE0JC123456",
  "startTimeUtc": "2026-09-22T09:00:00Z"
}
